{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG42xNJiha6iLoNi6pMh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"scores\":{\"design\":4,\"legibility\":4,\"visual_communication\":4,\"coherence\":5,\"requirements\":5},\"evidence\":{\"design\":\"The deck uses a consistent navy/teal/pink palette, card styling and left-aligned finding titles throughout. Slide 1 has a clear KPI-card row with a strong teal 'Decision requested' panel. Slide 8 reads cleanly in three columns (Fund today → Week-10 gate → GO/HOLD). Minor defects: on slides 4, 6, 7 and 8 the two-line titles push the subtitle tight against the title (slide 4 'Scenarios at 80 / 100 / 120%' and slide 6 'Critical path' sit almost touching). Slide 1 'Why act now' and slide 3 'The tradeoff' cards, plus the slide 4 pink callout, leave large empty lower halves.\",\"legibility\":\"Chart data labels on slides 2 and 4 are crisp, axes are readable and contrast is good. Slide 7 matrix labels R1–R5 are bold and large. Defects: on slide 5 the table header breaks mid-word as 'Headroom/d ay'. Slide 3 headers wrap ('Investment $k', 'Saving $k/yr'). On slide 6, small grey week markers (W1/W6/W10/W14) and the gate annotation text are light and small. The slide 3 footnote is small grey text.\",\"visual_communication\":\"Slide 2 clustered bars with labels make the M4 beat (+40) and M6 shortfall (−140) obvious, and side cards give the totals. Slide 4 bar chart plus table and breakeven callout (≥$147k/yr) explains why downside fails. Slide 6 swimlane shows Technical/Decision/People lanes with connectors from Validate and Train converging on the W10 gate, then Rollout W11–14. Slide 7 grid places R1–R5 correctly, paired with a score/mitigation table. Weaknesses: the slide 7 matrix has no severity shading of cells, so only text colour signals severity. Slide 6 week axis is sparse (only four markers), so week 9 slack is implicit.\",\"coherence\":\"The story follows the card order exactly: slide 1 decision/financials → 2 demand gap → 3 option comparison → 4 scenarios → 5 site capacity → 6 roadmap → 7 risks → 8 gate/funding ask. Layouts vary (KPI cards, chart+cards, table+callout, chart+table, swimlane, matrix+table, three-column decision). Threads are linked: the 99.5% gate appears on slides 1, 3 and 8; South's constraint on slides 1 and 5; on-time gaps on slide 5 feed slide 8 ('Today 2 of 5 meet it'); R5 backup-power ties to the slide 8 criterion.\",\"requirements\":\"Slide 1 shows $440k, $155k/yr, 2.8 yrs and +$25k with Resilient recommended. Slide 2 shows M4 actual 1080, other actuals 870/850/720/720/910, targets 950/970/840/1040/820/1050, totals 5,150/5,670/−520 and M1–M6 with Target/Actual legend in shipments. Slide 3 shows all option cells with the tradeoff explained. Slide 4 shows 124/155/186 labelled 80/100/120%, paybacks 3.5/2.8/2.4 and nets −68/+25/+118. Slide 5 shows all site cells and owners, 1,600/1,710 totals, and South constrained. Slide 6 shows Design W1–2, Build W3–5, Validate W6–8, Train W6–8, Gate W10 needing Validate AND Train, and Rollout W11–14. Slide 7 places R1(4,3), R2(2,5), R3(3,4), R4(2,2) and R5(3,5) with all mitigations. Slide 8 states Uptime ≥99.5%, all five sites ≥95% on time, backup-power test passed, and HOLD if any one fails. Derived figures (9.2%, 94% utilized, payback/net columns) follow the supplied formulas. Minor phrasing: 'tested early under R5' and 'until the committee reviews again' are not on the cards but are not numerical replacements.\"},\"checks\":[true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true,true],\"worst_slide\":5,\"most_important_fix\":\"On slide 5, widen the Headroom/day column (or rename it 'Headroom') so the header no longer breaks mid-word as 'Headroom/d ay'. At the same time, add spacing between the two-line titles and subtitles on slides 4, 6 and 8 so they don't crowd each other.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24617,"cache_read_input_tokens":1454,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24617},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40d3de07-9b4b-47b0-9afd-8555fa75eddc","uuid":"80939400-66a2-4cbf-8e43-c4e6fc4ce0b4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:59:08.507Z","request_id":"req_011CgG42w7Pmfn7pbvn1bZ47"}
